<%#
About Section Organism - Landing Page
Mission, Vision and Values section for Amexing Experience

Created by Denisse Maldonado
%>

<section class="mvv-section" id="about">
    <div class="mvv-section__container">
        <div class="mvv-section__decorative-wrapper">
            <div class="mvv-section__grid">
                <%# Mission Card %>
                <div class="mvv-section__card mvv-section__card--mission">
                    <h2 class="mvv-section__title">Misión</h2>
                    <p class="mvv-section__text">
                        Crear experiencias memorables<br>
                        que conecten a cada visitante con<br>
                        la esencia de San Miguel de<br>
                        Allende, a través de un servicio<br>
                        seguro, cálido y de alto nivel.
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <%# Vision Card %>
                <div class="mvv-section__card mvv-section__card--vision">
                    <h2 class="mvv-section__title">Visión</h2>
                    <p class="mvv-section__text">
                        Ser reconocidos por ofrecer la<br>
                        forma más confiable, refinada y<br>
                        auténtica de descubrir San Miguel<br>
                        de Allende, con un servicio definido<br>
                        por la excelencia, la calidez y el<br>
                        conocimiento local.
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <%# Values Card %>
                <div class="mvv-section__card mvv-section__card--values">
                    <%# Hearts positioned outside card borders %>
                    <img src="/images/heart_green.png" alt="" class="mvv-section__heart mvv-section__heart--valores-left">
                    <img src="/images/heart_green.png" alt="" class="mvv-section__heart mvv-section__heart--valores-right">
                    <%# Lines extending outward from hearts %>
                    <div class="mvv-section__heart-line mvv-section__heart-line--left"></div>
                    <div class="mvv-section__heart-line mvv-section__heart-line--right"></div>
                    <h2 class="mvv-section__title">Valores</h2>
                    
                    <div class="mvv-section__values-list">
                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Hospitalidad auténtica</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Recibimos a cada cliente con calidez, cercanía y un genuino espíritu de servicio, haciendo que se sienta bienvenido desde el primer momento.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Seguridad y confianza</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Priorizamos el bienestar de nuestros clientes en cada traslado, con conductores capacitados, procesos claros y una operación confiable.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Excelencia en el servicio</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Cuidamos cada detalle para ofrecer una experiencia consistente, profesional y alineada con los más altos estándares.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Orgullo por nuestras raíces</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Somos sanmiguelenses y compartimos con orgullo la cultura, historia y esencia de nuestro destino.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Compromiso con nuestro equipo</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Valoramos a las personas que forman parte de nuestra empresa, fomentando su crecimiento, bienestar y desarrollo profesional.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Pasión por lo que hacemos</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Amamos nuestro trabajo y eso se refleja en cada servicio, cada experiencia y cada relación que construimos.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mvv-section__value-item">
                            <h3 class="mvv-section__value-title">Evolución constante</h3>
                            <p class="mvv-section__value-text">Nos adaptamos, crecemos e innovamos para seguir ofreciendo experiencias cada vez más completas y relevantes.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.mvv-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #2e2e2d;
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
}

.mvv-section__container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 3rem;
}

.mvv-section__decorative-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    padding: 60px 40px;
}

.mvv-section__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
}

.mvv-section__card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 4rem 3rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    background: #2e2e2d;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 280px;
}

.mvv-section__card--mission,
.mvv-section__card--vision {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    aspect-ratio: 8 / 9;
}

.mvv-section__card--values {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 3rem 4rem;
}

.mvv-section__heart {
    position: absolute;
    width: 50px;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.6;
}

.mvv-section__heart--valores-left {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px;
    left: -100px;
}

.mvv-section__heart--valores-right {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px;
    right: -100px;
}

.mvv-section__heart-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: -25px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
}

.mvv-section__heart-line--left {
    left: -33%;
    width: 20%;
}

.mvv-section__heart-line--right {
    right: -33%;
    width: 20%;
}

.mvv-section__title {
    font-family: var(--font-newsreader);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.mvv-section__title::first-letter {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
}


.mvv-section__text {
    font-family: var(--font-myriad);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin: 0;
}

.mvv-section__values-list {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
}

.mvv-section__value-item {
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
}

.mvv-section__value-title {
    font-family: var(--font-newsreader);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

.mvv-section__value-title::first-letter {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
}

.mvv-section__value-text {
    font-family: var(--font-myriad);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: block;
    margin: 0; /* quita el margen por defecto del <p> (gap bajo el título) */
}

/* Hide hearts and lines on non-desktop devices */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .mvv-section__heart--valores-left,
    .mvv-section__heart--valores-right,
    .mvv-section__heart-line--left,
    .mvv-section__heart-line--right {
        display: none;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mvv-section {
        padding: 4rem 0;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__container {
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__decorative-wrapper {
        padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__card {
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        min-height: auto;
    }

    .mvv-section__card--mission,
    .mvv-section__card--vision {
        aspect-ratio: auto;
    }

    .mvv-section__card--values {
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__heart {
        width: 35px;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__value-title {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__value-text {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__text {
        font-size: 1rem;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .mvv-section__decorative-wrapper {
        padding: 30px 15px;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__title {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__card {
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__heart {
        width: 30px;
    }
    
    .mvv-section__text br {
        display: none;
    }
}
</style>